    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "662033ef_3c3efa07",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/ConnectivityService.java",
        "patchSetId": 18
      },
      "lineNbr": 572,
      "author": {
        "id": 1463964
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-21T01:11:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "AFAIU, with stable aidl and mainline we can never remove APIs. If we can\u0027t remove INetworkMonitorCallbacks#notifyNetworkTested, it seems to make sense to keep both. Given that this new event is really just EVENT_NETWORK_TESTED with a PersistableBundle, it can rely on the existing functionality in NetworkStateTrackerHandler.\n\nAnother option is to have INetworkMonitorCallbacks#notifyNetworkTested use an empty Bundle and still generate a ConnectivityReport.\n\nThoughts?",
      "parentUuid": "d056696a_16a74c3c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 572,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 572,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "4eb54bcdbe19cff94e863a7142bca802b56c835e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "094c5cb7_fb83401d",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/ConnectivityService.java",
        "patchSetId": 18
      },
      "lineNbr": 572,
      "author": {
        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-22T13:13:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes we can\u0027t remove notifyNetworkTested, but I think we can route it to just send a null Bundle no ? These ints here are not public API.\n\nHopefully you can\u0027t have notifyNetworkTested called on R, because the module is not supposed to be older than the OS (I think there might be corner cases), but if it happens I think it\u0027s reasonable to generate a ConnectivityReport.",
      "parentUuid": "662033ef_3c3efa07",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 572,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 572,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "4eb54bcdbe19cff94e863a7142bca802b56c835e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ff70852d_b9a4a232",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/ConnectivityService.java",
        "patchSetId": 18
      },
      "lineNbr": 572,
      "author": {
        "id": 1463964
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-30T07:44:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Got it. Removing this event definition in favor of changing EVENT_NETWORK_TESTED to handle messages received via notifyNetworkTested() and notifyNetworkTestedWithExtras().\n\nIn the event that notifyNetworkTested() is called, PersistableBundle.EMPTY will be used.\n\nNote that the timestamp for notifyNetworkTested() will be the timestamp at which the NetworkMonitorCallbacks instance receives the callback.",
      "parentUuid": "094c5cb7_fb83401d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 572,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 572,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "4eb54bcdbe19cff94e863a7142bca802b56c835e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
